<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About — {{.SiteName}}</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css">
    <script src="js/nav.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>

    {{template "nav" .}}

    <main class="mission-page">
        <h1>About {{.SiteName}}</h1>
        <p>{{.SiteName}} is an independent advocacy resource dedicated to raising awareness about the harms of genital cutting and connecting people with organizations working to end this practice.</p>
        <p>We are not affiliated with any single organization. Our goal is to provide a central hub where people can learn, find trusted resources, and take action.</p>
        <p>Every child deserves the right to bodily autonomy and informed consent. We believe that by helping people learn and understand this issue, we can contribute to a future where every child is protected.</p>
        <div class="tagline">Learn. Understand. Take action.</div>
    </main>

    <footer data-version="__COMMIT_SHA__">version: __COMMIT_SHA__</footer>

</body>
</html>
